ntibodies. (C) Distribution of peaks by Metagene analysis. (D) Heatmaps of H3K4me3, MAX, EP400 and ST (Ab5) ChIP peaks ranked by read density of H3K4me3 and scaled against the 75th percentile of genome-wide read density for each ChIP. (E) Meta-track analysis of ChIP-seq read density for MAX, EP400 and ST at all H3K4me3 peaks genome-wide. Regions are centered and ranked for H3K4me3 peaks over input.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 1771760, "created_date": "2017-10-13T17:38:15Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-19T12:26:12Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["PP 2A subunits", "protein phosphatase 2", "RB", "genome-wide CRISPR-Cas 9 screen", "MCC cell lines", "L-MYC", "gene expression", "tumor suppressor function", "15- component EP 400 histone acetyltransferase", "MYC homolog MYCL", "oncogenesis Merkel cell carcinoma", "Large T antigen", "heterodimeric partner MAX", "Merkel cell polyomavirus DNA", "ST", "MCPyV-positive MCC cell lines", "ST-MYCL-EP", "EP 400", "LT", "Small T antigen", "Merkel cell polyomavirus recruits MYCL"], "keywords": ["PP 2A subunits", "protein phosphatase 2", "RB", "genome-wide CRISPR-Cas 9 screen", "MCC cell lines", "L-MYC", "gene expression", "tumor suppressor function", "15- component EP 400 histone acetyltransferase", "MYC homolog MYCL", "oncogenesis Merkel cell carcinoma", "Large T antigen", "heterodimeric partner MAX", "Merkel cell polyomavirus DNA", "ST", "MCPyV-positive MCC cell lines", "ST-MYCL-EP", "EP 400", "LT", "Small T antigen", "Merkel cell polyomavirus recruits MYCL"], "categories": [{"id": 1, "title": "Biophysics", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 4, "title": "Biochemistry", "parent_id": 38, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 